{"type":"text","timestamp":1792582623146,"sessionID":"ses_ea1c34da1ffeE7mN8rSviQJH53","part":{"id":"prt_15e4002b1001vRLJRvUjV52ghU","messageID":"msg_15e3f790a001qcuUH4VmsJk7A3","sessionID":"ses_ea1c34da1ffeE7mN8rSviQJH53","type":"text","text":"\n\nNow I understand the setup: `graph` is a plain list of lists, `work_ratio = sum(candidate wall-time) / sum(offline wall-time)` where offline is a full numpy DFS. The certificate requires no forward-cross edges. Let me write the baseline: O(1) no-op detection + full recompute only on invalidation.\n\n","time":{"start":1792582615729,"end":1792582623141}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792582623186,"sessionID":"ses_ea1c34da1ffeE7mN8rSviQJH53","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-89115cbd86db94e2","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/ethomdt/thesis/runs/eval1_harness_dynamic_dfs_s2/candidate.py","content":"\"\"\"Dynamic DFS forest maintenance.\n\nMaintains a DFS forest (parent / discover / finish) from a fixed root (0)\nunder single edge insertions and deletions.\n\nA directed spanning forest is a genuine DFS forest iff it has no\nforward-cross edge (Yang et al. Lemma 1): for every edge u->v between\nreachable vertices with discover[u] < discover[v], v must be a descendant\nof u (discover[u] < discover[v] < finish[v] < finish[u]).\n\nStrategy:\n  * Most updates are no-ops for the forest:\n      - insert (u,v): only invalidates if it creates a forward-cross edge,\n        i.e. u and v reachable, discover[u] < discover[v], and v not a\n        descendant of u.  A back edge (discover[v] < discover[u]) or a\n        forward edge (v a descendant of u) keeps the forest valid.\n      - delete (u,v): only invalidates if it was a tree edge\n        (parent[v] == u).  Deleting a non-tree edge never creates a\n        forward-cross edge, so the forest stays valid.\n  * On the rare invalidating update we recompute the whole forest with a\n    single iterative DFS (O(n^2) on the adjacency matrix).\n\"\"\"\n\n\ndef _recompute(graph):\n    \"\"\"Full iterative DFS from root 0; returns (parent, discover, finish).\"\"\"\n    n = len(graph)\n    parent = [None] * n\n    discover = [None] * n\n    finish = [None] * n\n    timer = 0\n    stack = [(0, 0)]\n    discover[0] = 0\n    timer = 1\n    while stack:\n        u, i = stack[-1]\n        row = graph[u]\n        advanced = False\n        while i < n:\n            if row[i] == 1 and discover[i] is None:\n                parent[i] = u\n                discover[i] = timer\n                timer += 1\n                stack[-1] = (u, i + 1)\n                stack.append((i, 0))\n                advanced = True\n                break\n            i += 1\n        if not advanced:\n            stack.pop()\n            finish[u] = timer\n            timer += 1\n    return parent, discover, finish\n\n\ndef init(graph):\n    parent, discover, finish = _recompute(graph)\n    return {\"parent\": parent, \"discover\": discover, \"finish\": finish}\n\n\ndef _state(parent, discover, finish):\n    return {\"parent\": parent, \"discover\": discover, \"finish\": finish}\n\n\ndef insert_edge(graph, edge, state):\n    u, v = edge\n    parent = state[\"parent\"]\n    discover = state[\"discover\"]\n    finish = state[\"finish\"]\n    du = discover[u]\n    dv = discover[v]\n    # Either endpoint unreachable, or v discovered before u (back edge):\n    # the new edge cannot be a forward-cross edge, forest stays valid.\n    if du is None or dv is None or du >= dv:\n        return state\n    # u discovered before v: valid only if v is a descendant of u.\n    if not (dv < finish[v] < finish[u]):\n        parent, discover, finish = _recompute(graph)\n        return _state(parent, discover, finish)\n    return state\n\n\ndef delete_edge(graph, edge, state):\n    u, v = edge\n    # Only a tree edge removal invalidates the forest.\n    if state[\"parent\"][v] == u:\n        parent, discover, finish = _recompute(graph)\n        return _state(parent, discover, finish)\n    return state\n"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/home/ethomdt/thesis/runs/eval1_harness_dynamic_dfs_s2/candidate.py","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"runs/eval1_harness_dynamic_dfs_s2/candidate.py","time":{"start":1792582623132,"end":1792582623180}},"id":"prt_15e400568001PrSw5oSsgIkWMM","sessionID":"ses_ea1c34da1ffeE7mN8rSviQJH53","messageID":"msg_15e3f790a001qcuUH4VmsJk7A3"}}
